OL,3,GNEWSACity council's SEND plan could
OL,4,Aplug #9.9m deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shake-up of special educational needs
OL,7,Fand disabilities (SEND) services in a
OL,8,Fcity could help tackle nearly #10m of
OL,9,Fhistorical overspending.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council has been told
OL,12,Fit is eligible for a government grant
OL,13,Fworth #9.9m to help reduce its SEND
OL,14,Fdeficit following approval of its
OL,15,Freform plan.
OL,17,FThe three-year programme aims to
OL,18,Fprovide support earlier and closer to
OL,19,Fhome, while reducing reliance on
OL,20,Feducation, health and care plans
OL,21,F(EHCPs).
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
